    <string name="about_app">Ka ga BenSuet Stay</string>
    <string name="about_body">BenSuet Stay e thusa baithuti ba Aforika Borwa go bona bonno jo bo babalesegileng le jo bo netefaditsweng gaufi le khampase ya bone, ka ditlhopho tsa NSFAS le tsa go ipatelela mo lefelong le le lengwe. E agilwe ke Mansuet Dev.</string>
    <string name="osm_attribution">Dikgakala di dirisa data ya mafelo © batsenyi ba OpenStreetMap (Nominatim).</string>
    <string name="delete_account">Phimola akhaonte ya me</string>
    <string name="delete_account_subtitle">Tlosa porofaele ya gago le go tsena ka bosakhutleng</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_title">Phimola akhaonte ya gago?</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_body">Se se phimola porofaele ya gago ya BenSuet Stay le go tsena ka bosakhutleng. Se ga se kgone go busediwa morago.</string>
    <string name="account_deleted">Akhaonte ya gago e phimotswe.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">BenSuet Stay e kokoanya fela se e se tlhokang go golaganya baithuti le bonno.\n\nSe re se kokoanyang: leina la gago, imeile, aterese ya legae, setheo le mofuta wa thuso ya madi. Fa o dira kopo ya kamore re boloka gape nomoro ya gago ya boitshupo ya SA, nomoro ya moithuti, khampase, dintlha tsa wa losika wa gaufi le maina a dikwalo tse o di tlhophileng. Kwa beng ba matlo: leina, imeile le nomoro ya mogala.\n\nGoreng: go bontsha bonno jo bo maleba, go letlelela beng ba matlo go dira ka diponelo le dikopo tsa gago, le go go romelela dintšhwafatso ka tsone.\n\nKe mang yo o ka di bonang: ke wena fela, mong wa ntlo wa bonno jo o ikgolaganyang le jone, le batsamaisi ba BenSuet Stay. Melao ya tshireletso ya polokelo ya rona ya data e netefatsa seno.\n\nKwa di bolokwang teng: Google Firebase (Cloud Firestore, kgaolo ya Johannesburg). Diphasewete di laolwa ke Firebase Authentication mme ga di bolokwe ke app.\n\nDitshwanelo tsa gago ka fa tlase ga POPIA: o ka bona le go ntšhwafatsa dintlha tsa gago mo Dithulaganyo, mme wa phimola akhaonte ya gago nako nngwe le nngwe mo Dithulaganyo → Sephiri → Phimola akhaonte ya me. Mo go tse dingwe, dirisa Dithulaganyo → Thuso → Ikgolaganye le thuso.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q1">Ke beela jang go bona lefelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a1">Bula papatso mme o tobetse Beela go bona, morago o tlhophe letlha le nako. Mong wa ntlo o a go netefatsa kgotsa o a go gana, mme o amogela kitsiso ka tsela nngwe le nngwe.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q2">Ke dira jang kopo ya kamore?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a2">Bula papatso, tlhopha mofuta wa kamore mme o tobetse Tlhopha kamore. Baithuti ba NSFAS ba netefatsa dintlha tsa bone tsa NSFAS; ba ba ipatelelang ba oketsa dintlha tsa wa losika wa gaufi le dikwalo tsa bone. E sale morago mo Dithulaganyo → Dikopo tsa me.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q3">A nka dirisa app kwa ntle ga inthanete?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a3">Ee. Dipapatso tse o setseng o di butse di nna di bonala, mme dikopo tsa go bona kgotsa dikopo tse o di dirileng o se mo inthaneteng di bolokwa mo mogaleng wa gago mme di romelwa ka boyona fa o golagana gape.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q4">Goreng ke sa bone bonno jotlhe?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a4">Tsebe ya gae e simolola ka mofuta wa gago wa thuso ya madi le Gaufi le khampase ya me e butswe. Tobetsa Tsotlhe kgotsa Gaufi le khampase ya me go atolosa patlo, kgotsa o fetole seno mo Dithulaganyo → Sekirini sa gae.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q1">Ke mang yo o dirang le go fetola dipapatso tsa me?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a1">Setlhopha sa batsamaisi sa BenSuet Stay se dira dipapatso mme se di abela wena. Go fetola papatso kgotsa dintlha tsa gago, dirisa Ikgolaganye le thuso, kgotsa Kopa phetogo ka fa tlase ga Tshedimosetso ya motho.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q2">Ke dira jang ka dikopo tsa go bona?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a2">Bula Dipeeletso mme o netefatse kgotsa o gane kopo nngwe le nngwe. Fa o gana, naya lebaka mme o tshitshinye nako e nngwe. Moithuti o itsisiwa ka bonako.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q3">Go diragala eng fa ke amogela kopo?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a3">Lefelo le le lengwe le tlosiwa mo mofuteng oo wa kamore ka boyona, mme moithuti o bona ntlha ya gago mo Dikopo tsa me.</string>
</resources>
